goals={'eligible_history':'Return copied legal credit rows in original order, using day≤cutoff. Reject duplicate IDs and nonfinite times/amounts. Why: filtering after aggregation cannot undo leakage. This fixture assumes event day equals arrival day.', 'corrected_total':'Compute the uniform-sampling total estimator. Validate finite one-dimensional amounts and integer N≥k. Return 0 for N=k=0; reject k=0<N. Why: the full-count assumption must be visible in the interface.', 'stratified_metrics':'Align nonempty degree, prediction and target vectors; reject nonfinite inputs and invalid degrees. Return a dictionary keyed by string degree, with n, signed bias and RMSE. Why: pooled errors can hide a high-degree failure.'}
for solution in [False,True]:
 cells=[]
